  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:360px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-silver pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Soul Metabolization</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/ce/SR1-Soul_Consume.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20191018004851\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"SR1-Soul Consume\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/ce/SR1-Soul_Consume.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20191018004851\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/ce/SR1-Soul_Consume.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/516?cb=20191018004851 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/c/ce/SR1-Soul_Consume.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20191018004851 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"SR1-Soul Consume\" width=\"270\" height=\"203\" data-image-key=\"SR1-Soul_Consume.jpg\" data-image-name=\"SR1-Soul Consume.jpg\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Raziel (Legacy of Kain) eating a soul.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Feed on souls.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>feed off souls</b>. Variation of <a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Absorption\" title=\"Soul Absorption\">Soul Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Metabolization\" title=\"Metabolization\">Metabolization</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Associations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Associations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Anime\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Anime</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Live_Television/Movies\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Live Television/Movies</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Tabletop/Video_Games\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Tabletop/Video Games</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSoul_Metabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Soul/Spirit Hunger/Leech/Drain/Siphoning</li>\n<li>Soul/Spirit Eating/Feeding</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSoul_Metabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Users can sustain themselves/their powers by feeding off of souls into their body as a source for their powers and/or conditions.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Associations\">Associations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSoul_Metabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Metabolization\" title=\"Metabolization\">Metabolization</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Absorption\" title=\"Soul Absorption\">Soul Absorption</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSoul_Metabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>If users don't feed, they may starve.</li>\n<li>Users may be unable to stomach/metabolize the souls they consume due to them being too powerful or potent for them.</li>\n<li>Useless against <a href=\"/wiki/Eternal_Soul\" title=\"Eternal Soul\">Eternal Soul</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSoul_Metabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Also See: <i><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://tvtropes.org/pmwiki/pmwiki.php/Main/SoulEating\">Soul Eating</a></i> \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Anime\">Anime</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSoul_Metabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"https://bleach.fandom.com/wiki/Bount\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:bleach:Bount\">Bounts</a> (<i>Bleach</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bleach.fandom.com/wiki/Hollow\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:bleach:Hollow\">Hollows</a> (<i>Bleach</i>)\n<ul><li>Arrancars</li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bleach.fandom.com/wiki/Yhwach\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:bleach:Yhwach\">Yhwach</a> (<i>Bleach</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://inuyasha.fandom.com/wiki/Tsukumo_no_Gama\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"inuyasha:Tsukumo no Gama\">Tsukumo no Gama</a> (<i>InuYasha</i>)</li>\n<li>Mana Eimiya (<i>Super Dreadnought Girl 4946</i>)</li>\n<li>Gōki (<i>Yu Yu Hakusho</i>)</li></ul>\n<h3><span id=\"Live_Television.2FMovies\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Live_Television/Movies\">Live Television/Movies</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSoul_Metabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D7&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Crocotta (<i>Supernatural</i>)</li></ul>\n<h3><span id=\"Tabletop.2FVideo_Games\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Tabletop/Video_Games\">Tabletop/Video Games</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSoul_Metabolization%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D8&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Soul Bees (<i>Darkstalkers</i>)\n<ul><li>Q-Bee(s)</li>\n<li>P-Bees</li></ul></li>\n<li>Raziel (<i>Legacy of Kain</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://nwn2.fandom.com/wiki/Akachi\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:nwn2:Akachi\">Spirit-Eater curse/Akachi</a> (<i>Neverwinter Nights 2: Mask of the Betrayer</i>)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gall